Minimum Magic Attack: {*d,F1690009,mAtkMin}
 Maximum Magic Attack: {*d,F1690011,mAtkMax}
 Increases the base Attack value of magic damage by {*d,F1690009,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690011,pAtkMax} points and the base Healing value of magic Pathways by {*d,F1690034,pAtkMin}-{*d,F1690036,pAtkMax} points. The actual effect is influenced by the Skill multiplier and is independent of the Skill level. 
